OL,3,CAntisemitic incidents in London rise
OL,4,Cby nearly a quarter, new figures show
OL,6,FReports of antisemitic incidents
OL,7,Facross London have risen by almost a
OL,8,Fquarter, according to new figures
OL,9,Freleased by the Community Security
OL,10,FTrust (CST), with Barnet recording by
OL,11,Ffar highest number of cases in the
OL,12,Fcapital.
OL,14,FThe CST's latest report recorded 994
OL,15,Fanti-Jewish hate incidents across
OL,16,FLondon during the first six months of
OL,17,F2026.
OL,19,FThat represents a 24 per cent increase
OL,20,Fcompared with the same period last
OL,21,Fyear, when 800 incidents were reported.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G1/7
