OL,3,CAntisemitic incidents in London rise
OL,4,Cby nearly a quarter, new figures show
OL,6,FThe figures mean London accounted for
OL,7,Fmore than half of the 1,926
OL,8,Fantisemitic incidents recorded across
OL,9,Fthe UK between January and June this
OL,10,Fyear.
OL,12,FNationally, the total is the second-
OL,13,Fhighest ever recorded by the CST for
OL,14,Fthe first half of a year.
OL,16,FIn London, Barnet recorded 469
OL,17,Fincidents, almost half the capital's
OL,18,Ftotal. The north London borough is
OL,19,Fhome to the UK's largest Jewish
OL,20,Fcommunity.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G2/7
