PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1786024093
OL,3,CAntisemitic incidents in London rise
OL,4,Cby nearly a quarter, new figures show
OL,6,FElsewhere, Westminster recorded 75
OL,7,Fincidents, Camden 73, Hackney 55 and
OL,8,FHaringey 25.
OL,10,FThe CST, a charity that monitors
OL,11,Fantisemitism and provides security
OL,12,Fadvice to Britain's Jewish
OL,13,Fcommunities, said the figures
OL,14,Fdemonstrate levels of anti-Jewish hate
OL,15,Fremain significantly higher than they
OL,16,Fwere before the conflict in the Middle
OL,17,FEast.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G3/7
