OL,3,CAntisemitic incidents in London rise
OL,4,Cby nearly a quarter, new figures show
OL,6,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,FThe organisation has previously warned
OL,12,Fthat periods of heightened
OL,13,Finternational tension, particularly
OL,14,Finvolving Israel and Gaza, are often
OL,15,Ffollowed by increases in antisemitic
OL,16,Fabuse, threats and criminal offences
OL,17,Fin the UK.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G4/7
