OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1786024093
OL,3,CAntisemitic incidents in London rise
OL,4,Cby nearly a quarter, new figures show
OL,6,FThe incidents recorded by the CST
OL,7,Finclude a wide range of behaviour,
OL,8,Ffrom abusive language and online hate
OL,9,Fto vandalism, threats and physical
OL,10,Fassaults.
OL,12,FThe charity collects reports from
OL,13,Fvictims, witnesses, police forces and
OL,14,Fpartner organisations before verifying
OL,15,Fincidents that meet its criteria.
OL,17,FLondon has consistently recorded the
OL,18,Fhighest number of antisemitic
OL,19,Fincidents of any region in the UK
OL,20,Fbecause it has the country's largest
OL,21,FJewish population.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G5/7
