PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1786024093
OL,3,CAntisemitic incidents in London rise
OL,4,Cby nearly a quarter, new figures show
OL,6,FAreas such as Barnet, Hackney and
OL,7,FCamden have substantial Jewish
OL,8,Fcommunities, making them key locations
OL,9,Fmonitored by the CST.
OL,11,FThe Metropolitan Police investigates
OL,12,Fcriminal offences motivated by
OL,13,Fhostility towards religion or race as
OL,14,Fhate crimes, with officers working
OL,15,Falongside community organisations to
OL,16,Fsupport victims and improve reporting.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G6/7
