PN,37507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F375A1786024093
OL,3,CAntisemitic incidents in London rise
OL,4,Cby nearly a quarter, new figures show
OL,6,FThe publication of the latest figures
OL,7,Fcomes amid continued concern over
OL,8,Fcommunity tensions linked to events in
OL,9,Fthe Middle East and renewed calls for
OL,10,Fefforts to tackle antisemitism and
OL,11,Fother forms of hate crime.
OL,13,FWhile this year's national total
OL,14,Fremains below the record level seen in
OL,15,F2024, the latest figures suggest
OL,16,Fantisemitic incidents continue at
OL,17,Fhistorically high levels.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G7/7
